abstract: >-
  CEREBRUM is a biologically plausible, backpropagation-free learning
  architecture with fully local plasticity, targeted at neuromorphic edge
  hardware. Written in pure NumPy — no autograd, no PyTorch or JAX — it
  coordinates inference, routing and learning as noisy gradient descent on
  a single unified free-energy functional across three physical timescales.
